---
title: 'Debugging Agent'
description: 'Systematic bug diagnosis and resolution through root cause analysis and generalization.'
---

The Debugging Agent provides systematic bug diagnosis and resolution. It follows an 8-step debugging methodology for complex issues and adapts its approach — conversational for general questions, rigorous and structured for actual bugs.

